<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_58f849907b52e99bd23af800f8d763a8229c9f259761916e6f9cd2caf9fafd1d_n0081/e_0015> <http://digistrucmed.org/entityType> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-type/OUTCOME> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_58f849907b52e99bd23af800f8d763a8229c9f259761916e6f9cd2caf9fafd1d_n0081/tu_0002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "2. Patients considering implantation of a new ICD or replacement of an existing ICD for a low battery should be informed of their individual risk of SCD and nonsudden death from HF or noncardiac conditions and the effectiveness, safety, and potential complications of the ICD in light of their health goals, preferences and values (S15-1–S15-5)." .
